# 078 codegen golden SET — byte-compared, LF-generated (fixpp-codegen writes
# with std::ios::binary). Unlike other features' goldens these files keep
# their real emitted names (groups.hpp, all.hpp, messages/<Msg>.{hpp,builder.inl,
# validator.inl,builder.cpp,validator.cpp}) rather than a `*.golden.hpp` suffix,
# so the root .gitattributes' `*.golden.hpp -text` rule does not reach them.
# Pin -text so a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true on windows-msvc runners)
# cannot CRLF-rewrite them and false-break the byte-exact determinism gate
# (tests/codegen/determinism_test.cpp — 074/075/076/077 precedent,
# feedback_byte_exact_sha1_gate_needs_gitattributes_text).
*.hpp -text
*.inl -text
*.cpp -text
